# CustomerFD release approvers — maintainer YubiKey (FIDO2) public keys. OPTIONAL.
#
# Leave this file without key lines to rely on the CI minisign signature alone (current setup).
# Once at least one key is listed, the updater in builds made from this source refuses any update
# whose latest.json lacks an approval signed with one of these keys
# (ssh-keygen -Y sign -n customerfd-release, touch + PIN). Only hardware-backed
# "sk-ssh-ed25519@openssh.com" keys are accepted. One key per line, e.g.
# sk-ssh-ed25519@openssh.com AAAAGnNr... (YubiKey)
